                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exceptional+generalized+geometry"} exceptional generalized geometry
          %p
            See also at
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+%28physics%29"} field (physics)
            the section on
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a{:href => "field%20%28physics%29#OrdinaryGravity"} Ordinary gravity
          %h2#references References
          %p
            Original discussion in
            = succeed "\u2018s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%89lie+Cartan"} Élie Cartan
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riemannian+geometry"} Riemannian geometry
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartan+geometry"}> Cartan geometry
            ):
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%89lie+Cartan"} Élie Cartan
              (translated by Vladislav Goldberg from Cartan’s lectures at the Sorbonne in 1926–27): Chapter 1 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Riemannian Geometry in an Orthogonal Frame
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/4808"} doi:10.1142/4808
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://softbank.iust.ac.ir/MathBooks/c/Cartan%20-%20Riemannian%20Geometry%20in%20an%20Orthogonal%20Frame.pdf"} pdf
          %p Lecture notes:
          %ul
            %li#Wang24
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zuoqin+Wang"}> Zuoqin Wang
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The method of moving frames
              %em Riemannian geometry
              (2024) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://staff.ustc.edu.cn/~wangzuoq/Courses/24S-RiemGeom/"}> webpage
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://staff.ustc.edu.cn/~wangzuoq/Courses/24S-RiemGeom/Notes/Lec11.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Review in the context of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/first-order+formulation+of+gravity"} first-order formulation of gravity
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"}> Pietro Fré
              , §3.2.5, §5.2.1 in:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Gravity, a Geometrical Course
              = succeed "," do
                %em Development of the Theory and Basic Physical Applications
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-94-007-5361-7"} doi:10.1007/978-94-007-5361-7
          %p
            Discussion in the general context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-structures"} G-structures
            includes
          %ul
            %li#Lott90
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Lott"}> John Lott
